   "html": "<p>Dressed to the nines “IHC style,” guests gathered while a cascade of talent shared the limelight, all exploring the annals of IHC’s past through interactive installations, photo and art displays, experiential art, and branded photo moments.</p>"
  }
 ],
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "TALENT & SURPRISE GUESTS",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>Comedian Reggie Watts kicked off the night center stage as the evening’s host. The evening continued with various music, talent and surprise guests including a DJ set by The Dare, Nation of Language, Fcukers' debut Los Angeles performance, DJ Suga Shay, Chela, and surprise guest Boys Noize. The climax of the evening featured a suprise video from Benedict Wong, a special magic show by The Cosmic Romantics and Yo Gabba Gabba appearing to sing Happy Birthday to IHC.</p>\n<p>‍</p>"
    },
