   "title": "GUEST LIST & ATMOSPHERE",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>All were encouraged to dress in “IHC Chic” and showed off their flashy fits while entering the party; inspiration was drawn from our curated moodboard shared within the invite. The interior was inspired by our bold brand colors, drenching the space in colored lights, velvet curtains and bespoke furniture.</p>\n<p>‍</p>"
