  {
   "title": "PHOTO MOMENTS",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>A branded Tommy B Photo Booth and a custom IHC20 set gave guests an opportunity to memorialize the night and act as hosts of their very own show. Additionally, we had a lively karaoke room to sing their hearts out. The front lobby boasted multiple photo moments, including a Media Pollution installation showcasing a video montage of IHC’s greatest hits.</p>"
    },
