  {
   "title": "DECOR & TOUCHPOINTS",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text2",
     "left": "<p>The iconic Heartschallenger truck, decked out in countless Swarovski crystals, made a rare appearance outside the venue, greeting arrivals with a sparkling backdrop and goodies. Guests could discover a full gallery room with art installations showcasing 20 years of IHC history.</p>",
     "right": "<p>The Virginian restaurant inside the venue provided guests with light bites and pizza while the bar served wine, beer and specialty cocktails including the Fucking Awesome Spicy Margarita and Comix Classic Old Fashioned.</p>"
    },
